Subject: [PATCH] feat: offer quick replies in groups

Offer business quick replies from slash autocomplete in groups when enabled and resend their content as regular messages.

Constraint: Private-chat quick reply replay stays stock

Confidence: medium

Scope-risk: moderate

Not-tested: Manual group autocomplete and media shortcut replay
